        {
          "text": "Oo reer Xebroonna Yeriyaah madax buu ahaa, intaasu waa reer Xebroon sidii dadka reerahoodu u kala dhasheen. Oo waxaa iyaga la doondoonay sannaddii afartanaad oo boqortooyadii Daa'uud, oo waxaa iyaga dhexdoodii laga helay rag xoog badan oo jooga Yacser tii reer Gilecaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
